&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;701&quot;&gt;The company is based in New York with offices in Los Angeles, Atlanta and Jersey City, as well as in Canada, Scotland, Ireland, Portugal, Romania and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
